WEBVTT

10:54.480 --> 10:57.880
Sir.

11:00.280 --> 11:02.360
The island of Miquelon.

11:30.360 --> 11:34.160
The commissioner said
to give us two hours. Someone may die.

11:34.680 --> 11:37.200
If it's me, tell them to call my brother.

13:14.840 --> 13:15.800
I'm coming.

13:31.800 --> 13:35.160
My name is Thomas Shelby.
I have the meeting room booked.

13:37.160 --> 13:39.560
Last night, some drunks broke my windows.

13:40.160 --> 13:43.480
Pigeons got inside the big room.
My wife is clearing them out.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.720
I'm early, I'll wait.

14:47.520 --> 14:49.120
Another bottle of whiskey.

14:57.840 --> 14:59.640
You work for the whiskey company, right?

15:13.320 --> 15:15.480
I'm here on private business.

15:21.680 --> 15:23.360
Where did you learn French?

15:23.440 --> 15:24.720
In France.

15:49.400 --> 15:51.080
Jean-Claude, leave the man alone.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.840
Jean-Claude, please. Leave it alone.

17:31.760 --> 17:33.000
He's a good one, isn't he?

17:47.920 --> 17:48.840
Fuck!

18:02.240 --> 18:03.840
What happened?

18:44.280 --> 18:46.880
Excuse me, where is the Hotel Robert?

27:44.360 --> 27:45.280
My brother.

30:22.600 --> 30:25.200
Every catastrophe is also an opportunity.

33:02.280 --> 33:03.760
Put me through to Detective Lawrence

33:03.840 --> 33:06.000
at the St John's Harbour Marine Police.

33:49.600 --> 33:50.920
You want a drink, comrade?

33:58.840 --> 33:59.760
Why?
